---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base title="Bishal Hona" fit>
  <section class="hero shell">
    <p class="label hero__kicker">Backend engineering for AI products</p>

    <h1 class="serif hero__title">
      Backend that stays calm<br />when things break.
    </h1>

    <p class="hero__lede measure">
      I'm Bishal Hona, a product-minded backend engineer. I build the systems
      behind AI products, and I've gone deep on the infrastructure right under
      the AI features themselves. The background jobs, the memory that survives
      across sessions, the streaming, the auth. That's the layer where a lot of
      AI products quietly succeed or fail, so it's the one I've spent the most
      time getting right.
    </p>

    <p class="hero__ai serif">
      Plenty of AI products look great in a demo. I build the part that keeps
      them working once real people are using them.
    </p>

    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="cta" href="/work">
        <span>See how I built Nura</span>
        <span class="cta__arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cta cta--ghost" href="/writing">Read the writing</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 2rem + 6vw, 7rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(2rem, 1.5rem + 3vw, 4rem);
  }
  .hero__kicker { margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }
  .hero__title {
    font-size: var(--step-4);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .hero__lede {
    margin-top: clamp(1.5rem, 1rem + 2vw, 2.4rem);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--graphite);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .hero__ai {
    margin-top: clamp(1.8rem, 1.2rem + 2vw, 2.8rem);
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--ink);
    max-width: 46ch;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .hero__actions {
    margin-top: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2vw, 3rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6em;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--paper);
    background: var(--ink);
    padding: 0.85em 1.3em;
    border-radius: 3px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    transition: background 200ms var(--ease), color 200ms var(--ease);
  }
  .cta__arr { transition: transform 220ms var(--ease); }
  .cta:hover { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); }
  .cta:hover .cta__arr { transform: translateX(4px); }
  .cta--ghost {
    color: var(--graphite);
    background: transparent;
    border-color: var(--mist);
  }
  .cta--ghost:hover { color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--graphite); }

  @media (max-width: 46rem) {
    .hero__title { max-width: none; }
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     Home-only: the whole page lives in exactly one viewport, no scroll.
     100dvh accounts for mobile browser chrome. Type and spacing are sized in
     dvh so the hero shrinks to fit short viewports (small laptops, phones in
     landscape) instead of overflowing the fixed height. Content is never
     removed to fit; only type and rhythm compress.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------ */
  :global(body.fit) {
    height: 100dvh;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  :global(body.fit main) {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-height: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  :global(body.fit .nav) { padding-block: clamp(0.55rem, 1.6dvh, 1.9rem); }
  :global(body.fit .foot) {
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-block: clamp(0.6rem, 1.8dvh, 3.5rem);
  }

  :global(body.fit) .hero {
    padding-top: clamp(0.5rem, 2dvh, 3rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(0.5rem, 2dvh, 3rem);
  }
  :global(body.fit) .hero__kicker { margin-bottom: clamp(0.5rem, 1.8dvh, 1.6rem); }
  :global(body.fit) .hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 7.2dvh, var(--step-4));
  }
  :global(body.fit) .hero__lede {
    margin-top: clamp(0.5rem, 2.2dvh, 2.4rem);
    font-size: clamp(0.82rem, 2.4dvh, var(--step-1));
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  :global(body.fit) .hero__ai {
    margin-top: clamp(0.5rem, 2.2dvh, 2.8rem);
    font-size: clamp(0.82rem, 2.2dvh, var(--step-1));
    line-height: 1.38;
  }
  :global(body.fit) .hero__actions {
    margin-top: clamp(0.8rem, 2.6dvh, 3rem);
  }
</style>
